        "verse": 2
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "MRK",
          "chapter": 12,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "When it was time, he sent a servant to the farmer to get from the farmer his share of the fruit of the vineyard.",
      "ko": "때가 이르매 농부들에게 포도원 소출 얼마를 받으려고 한 종을 보내니",
      "source_text_hash": "2b7c3645c6d773d387ccb50b2133171990f1e773e67ca197992da28618c549a2",
      "translation_text_hash": "9dc05ff917fde5d2fe8543f3b788d6e7d4262fdb314f4cf1d2291c02a177f3f5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "때가 이르매 농부들에게 포도원 소출 얼마를 받으려고 한 종을 보내니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9dc05ff917fde5d2fe8543f3b788d6e7d4262fdb314f4cf1d2291c02a177f3f5"
      ]
