      "en": "Again, he sent another servant to them; and they threw stones at him, wounded him in the head, and sent him away shamefully treated.",
      "ko": "다시 다른 종을 보내니 그의 머리에 상처를 내고 능욕하였거늘",
      "source_text_hash": "8e498bb18236725aa13246cf5261e1a58ddabe6d4d0a17022da395375fcdc7d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "5a524093fc693148689b8e4a73dc0b242c304efd25c32783ecff13f41e840ee5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "다시 다른 종을 보내니 그의 머리에 상처를 내고 능욕하였거늘"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "5a524093fc693148689b8e4a73dc0b242c304efd25c32783ecff13f41e840ee5"
      ]
